# Everything under data/ is the operator's own material — photographs, records,
# ledgers, archives. None of it belongs in a shared repo. `group_batch.py init`
# recreates the whole tree on a fresh clone, so nothing is lost by ignoring it
# wholesale rather than committing placeholder directories.
data/

# Local state: what this particular machine has shipped, what is half-done, which
# books are outstanding. Useful to keep, meaningless to anyone else, and it names
# real people and real books.
STATE.md

# Catalogue raisonné scripts — a second, private collection running through the same
# pipeline. Kept working, not shared.
scripts/cr/

# Credentials for Supabase and R2. Never.
.env
.env.*

# Apply logs carry item ids and titles.
*.log

# Scratch and OS noise
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
